0..77 Comment "// A call nested inside an expression runs first, and its result stands where"
78..96 Comment "// the call stood."
97..99 Comment "//"
100..178 Comment "// A computation is a value only once it runs, so each nested call runs before"
179..251 Comment "// the expression that reads it. A run a value definition cannot hold is"
252..279 Comment "// refused `UnenclosedRun`."
280..282 Comment "//"
283..360 Comment "// The checker sequences each nested call before its reader. A call returning"
361..438 Comment "// a function runs before the call it is passed to, and before an application"
439..451 Comment "// in place."
452..454 Comment "//"
455..506 Comment "// - see: #2327 — `passed_alone`, `passed_beside`"
